      "differences[]": "Seats where the guide and districts.json differ: district, ours {party, vs, pct}, theirs (as in seats[]), reasons (holder: a different party holds the margin; pair: a different two-party contest; margin: same contest, gap above the tolerance), gap (theirs - ours, points, same contest only). Recomputed at every refresh, so a change to our margins shows at once"
    }
